  "helpFaq1Category": "Account",
  "helpFaq1Question": "How do I create an account?",
  "helpFaq1Answer": "You can create an account by clicking on \"Sign Up\" and using your email or your Google account. It's free and only takes a few seconds.",
  "helpFaq2Category": "Account",
  "helpFaq2Question": "How do I change my password?",
  "helpFaq2Answer": "Go to your profile, then to \"Settings\" and select \"Change password\". You will receive an email with instructions.",
  "helpFaq3Category": "Account",
  "helpFaq3Question": "Can I delete my account?",
  "helpFaq3Answer": "Yes, you can delete your account from your profile settings. Note that this will delete all your ads and associated data.",
  "helpFaq4Category": "Ads",
  "helpFaq4Question": "How do I publish an ad?",
  "helpFaq4Answer": "Log in, click on \"Publish Ad\", fill out the form with title, description, price, category, and photos. It's free!",
  "helpFaq5Category": "Ads",
  "helpFaq5Question": "How many photos can I upload?",
  "helpFaq5Answer": "You can upload up to 10 photos per ad. We recommend clear, high-quality photos to attract more buyers.",
  "helpFaq6Category": "Ads",
  "helpFaq6Question": "How long does an ad last?",
  "helpFaq6Answer": "Ads remain active until you delete them or sell the product. We recommend updating them periodically.",
  "helpFaq7Category": "Ads",
  "helpFaq7Question": "Can I edit my ad after publishing?",
  "helpFaq7Answer": "Yes, you can edit any ad from \"My Ads\". You can change the title, description, price, photos, and more.",
  "helpFaq8Category": "Promotions",
  "helpFaq8Question": "What is a featured ad?",
  "helpFaq8Answer": "A featured ad appears in the top search positions and on the homepage, increasing its visibility up to 10 times.",
  "helpFaq9Category": "Promotions",
  "helpFaq9Question": "How much does it cost to feature an ad?",
  "helpFaq9Answer": "We have plans from €4.99 for 3 days up to €29.99 for 30 days. You can see all plans when promoting your ad.",
  "helpFaq10Category": "Promotions",
  "helpFaq10Question": "What payment methods do you accept?",
  "helpFaq10Answer": "We accept credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express) and Google Pay through Stripe, our secure payment processor.",
  "helpFaq11Category": "Safety",
  "helpFaq11Question": "Is it safe to buy/sell here?",
  "helpFaq11Answer": "Foxy Ads is an ad platform. We recommend meeting in public places, checking products before paying, and never sharing bank details.",
